## 🌟 Project Overview

A **full-stack intelligent learning platform** that tracks user behavior and provides **personalized resource recommendations** using a hybrid backend system.

It combines:

- Activity tracking system  
- Recommendation engine  
- Analytics dashboard  
- Notification system  

to deliver a **personalized learning experience for students**.

---

## ✨ Features

### 👤 Authentication & Roles
- Secure login system
- Role-based access (Student / Admin)
- Protected routes

---

### 📚 Resource Management
- Add and manage learning resources
- Each resource contains:
  - Name
  - URL
  - Category
- Track resource views and engagement

---

### 🔥 Trending System
- Automatically detects popular resources
- Based on user interaction data

---

### 🧠 Recommendation System
- Tracks user activity (views, clicks)
- Suggests relevant resources dynamically
- Personalized recommendations per user

---

### 📊 Analytics Dashboard
- User activity tracking
- Resource engagement insights
- Most viewed resources
- System usage analytics

---

### 🔔 Notification System
- Notifications for:
  - New resources
  - New recommendations
- Read / unread status support

---


---

